BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 397.77 Tm (The headline failure is a tenant that walks. Acquisition Insider builds the case from real numbers: a buyer pays 15 times) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 382.55 Tm (in 2023 for a ground lease whose only tenant is Dish, $1,200 a month on a new 5G site, $222,000 all in; the excused) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 367.32 Tm (letter lands in October 2025, rent stops by year end after about $36,000 collected, and by June 2026 Dish is in) Tj ET
