BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 321.65 Tm (terminates in year eight, returning about $160,000 against $260,000 invested. That is why the pros haircut single-carrier) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 306.42 Tm (sites. Tower Genius was already treating Dish as toxic to the buyout industry in 2024, saying nobody wanted to touch it) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 291.20 Tm (with a 10-foot pole and that buyers demand the sub-tenant names so they do not get caught holding the bag) Tj ET
