BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 557.77 Tm (Casella sees one landowner mistake constantly: greed on the wrong day. Owners demand revenue share and co-location) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 542.55 Tm (subleasing before the tower company has done a site walk or spent a dime on engineering. His warning: 'you don't want) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 527.32 Tm (to set the hook before they swallow the bait' [QV7EDp7ej3A @ 00:04:54]. He flags Tillman Infrastructure proposals) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 512.10 Tm (for AT&T FirstNet with 90-year terms, built as a 10-year initial term plus multiple five-year extensions, which only) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 496.87 Tm (make sense if you are fine taking 500 or 600 a month. Pricing by antenna count is another trap. Start with 12 antennas,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 481.65 Tm (and when technology shrinks the load to six, the tower company comes back asking for a 50% rent cut [nUDRfQeqe7A) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 466.42 Tm (@ 00:04:05]. He also warns that site acquisition reps find the cheapskate or desperate neighbor, lowball that person all) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 451.20 Tm (day long, and play them against you. Odum adds the structural risk. Tower companies put confidentiality agreements in) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 435.97 Tm (the leases so you never learn what the owner next door is paid or what they earn. Meanwhile, the restrictions you sign) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 420.75 Tm (reach across all of your property, not just the leased area [iRtPyU-Kh2o @ 00:00:24]. His blunt summary: if they hand) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 405.52 Tm (you $2 while getting $10 worth of value, 'they like that deal every day' [uuYMqpFuo3Y @ 00:01:05].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 390.30 Tm (On the truck parking side, Evan Shealy's rejection pile is predictable. Grass lots almost never work, and anything near) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 375.07 Tm (active retail is 'a no-go', because trucks would have to drive through areas of active retail to reach the spaces) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 359.85 Tm ([NIYpBpIvXTc @ 00:05:53]. Raw land is the slow trap. When a listener's contact offered 6 undeveloped acres, Evan) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 344.62 Tm (warned that developing it takes 24 months and turns you into an owner's rep. You also have to spend real money just to) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 329.40 Tm (find the real cost. Flip Man added that in development 'you'll spend money just to see that you don't want it') Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 314.17 Tm ([NIYpBpIvXTc @ 00:25:13]. Free parkers are a fear new operators overrate. But when a paying trucker arrives to a full) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 298.95 Tm (lot, the operator refunds them immediately and hands the free parker a flyer explaining the spot is paid [NIYpBpIvXTc) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 283.72 Tm (@ 00:52:15]. On owned yards, Ron requires every vehicle to be operational and sitting on four inflated tires. Junked) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 268.50 Tm (vehicles leak coolant and oil and open up environmental issues, and many municipalities require the rule under the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 253.27 Tm (zoning anyway [IRDT0HnPpUc @ 00:04:13]. He also learned that multi-tenant layouts immediately escalate conflicts) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 238.05 Tm (and make the landlord the mediator between tenants. His roughest fleet tenants made that management load very real.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 222.82 Tm (The economics checks start with sourcing reality. Chris Long warns that IOS is an extremely scarce asset class. You) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 207.60 Tm (cannot send a thousand mailers like you would to flip houses, and once you know the few sites in your area, they) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 192.37 Tm (become 'the red punch buggy' [I_8AzWShUAU @ 00:07:01]. His own scar tissue came from speed. As a contractor, he) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 177.15 Tm (went from 16 employees to a large commercial contract that never paid, which left him working alone and unable to) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 161.92 Tm (afford gas. That is why Longard now sequences acquisitions behind financial prep and operational strengthening) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 146.70 Tm ([I_8AzWShUAU @ 00:19:39]. Realty Returns hard-codes the underwriting discipline. Price rent per acre per month off) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 131.47 Tm (LoopNet comps and calls to nearby yards, and use conservative vacancy. 'Buy on day one yield, not vibes'. Before) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 116.25 Tm (closing, clear a Phase 1 environmental, an ALTA survey, access easements, zoning in writing and storm water checks,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 101.02 Tm (and avoid flood plains [6YQWIQERSYQ @ 00:02:05]. MrHermers names the risk at the other extreme. An abandoned) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 85.80 Tm (junkyard being repositioned into a truck yard has no income stream, and commercial investors buy income streams.) Tj ET
