q 0 0 0 RG 54.00 680.35 504.00 15.22 re S Q
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 62.00 684.35 Tm (Practitioners agree a cell tower is a real estate business selling space at height, and that the first tenant pays the bills) Tj ET
q 0 0 0 RG 54.00 665.12 504.00 15.22 re S Q
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 62.00 669.12 Tm (while every tenant after that pays the owner. Builds run $150K to $500K, with a typical monopole near $275K;) Tj ET
q 0 0 0 RG 54.00 649.90 504.00 15.22 re S Q
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 62.00 653.90 Tm (anchor rents sit around $1,500 to $2,500 a month. One tenant yields as little as 1% to 3% with paybacks of 34 to 75) Tj ET
q 0 0 0 RG 54.00 634.67 504.00 15.22 re S Q
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 62.00 638.67 Tm (years, a second converts about 90% to 97% to profit, and a third pushes returns past 24%. Leases carry 5 to 10 year) Tj ET
q 0 0 0 RG 54.00 619.45 504.00 15.22 re S Q
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 62.00 623.45 Tm (initial terms, about 3% escalators, and 1% to 2% churn, with permits as the moat. The splits are on the landowner) Tj ET
q 0 0 0 RG 54.00 604.22 504.00 15.22 re S Q
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 62.00 608.22 Tm (side: buyout multiples quoted at 9 to 12x, 15 to 20x, and 15 to 25x rent, and Vertical Consultants rejecting market) Tj ET
