BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 142.82 Tm (a full face replacement in one strike.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 127.60 Tm (Fights over permits and dirt eat the margin quietly. Justin Booher's ninth sign drew a lawsuit from a wealthy) Tj ET
