BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 375.55 Tm (The city kills more IOS deals than the market does. Ron Rohde, reviewing a 5.5-acre graveled truck-parking site 24) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 360.32 Tm (months after closing, names the city the number one issue: zoning, setbacks, fire lanes, sprinklers, sewer and utility) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 345.10 Tm (questions, with the fix being confirmation that the jurisdiction is friendly before going under contract [gcg4K6xqYaU) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 329.87 Tm (@ 00:05:42]. The site drew 50 to 75-plus tours, including national and credit groups, and still could not sign a lease) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 314.65 Tm (without the city's green light. Ron's next steps there are regulatory work and landing a compatible use. Benji Miller) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 299.42 Tm (avoids that trap by front-loading the work, running heavy diligence before contract on the Fontana deal, including) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 284.20 Tm (land-use attorney Alan Mackins, because of zoning landmines [7qT_5Pw0cTo @ 00:08:56]. Chris Long of Longyards) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 268.97 Tm (paid for the same lesson in a different currency: 12 easements on one site caused a 2-year loss and raised costs by a) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 253.75 Tm (third [RPNJmiZNQdY @ 00:39:23]. Chris also flags that some Texas cities limit unbuilt sites to 5 years and that in) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 238.52 Tm (DFW a structure was required for full occupancy; the DFW location fell through, and Tier 1 land with existing) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 223.30 Tm (heavy-industrial use is where Longyards now concentrates [7n_O1KWl4EQ @ 00:04:15].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 208.07 Tm (Thin NOI plus the wrong debt is the second killer. On that same site, rents climbed from $100 per stall to $215 to $225) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 192.85 Tm (against a pro forma of $150, yet insurance rose several thousand dollars and net income stayed flat [gcg4K6xqYaU @) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 177.62 Tm (00:04:45]. A 5-year fixed note at about 5.5% saved their bacon; Ron says variable debt plus a thin NOI would have) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 162.40 Tm (meant pain, and calls the lender a very powerful ally but a heavy sword. Benji Miller flags the same exposure at) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 147.17 Tm (portfolio scale: 2022 and 2023 vintage portfolios on 3-year loans face liquidity events, so expect recaps and new debt) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 131.95 Tm (facilities [7qT_5Pw0cTo @ 00:35:08]. Evan Shelley of Truck Parking Club says a lot of underwriting in the last couple) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 116.72 Tm (of years just made no sense, and that the lots that failed were too far out or over-leased; buying property in the middle) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 101.50 Tm (of Kentucky or Tennessee, not close to anything, on the assumption you will fill it is not a wise decision) Tj ET
