BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 559.32 Tm (parcels, in service with four lines at 100 kV, but nobody except the utility can confirm capacity [yVhfvSQwGRQ @) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 544.10 Tm (00:01:00]. The cleared site is not flat: 11 contour lines cross the parcel from 975 to 1,025 feet, 50 feet of fall on) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 528.87 Tm (Clifford sandy clay loam at 6 to 10% slopes, so grading, cut, fill and maybe a retaining wall go into the price) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 513.65 Tm ([yVhfvSQwGRQ @ 00:01:23]. Then the price and zoning: one parcel last sold for $17,500 in July 2020 and now asks) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 498.42 Tm (135,450, about 7.7 times its last sale, the pair last sold for just short of 70,000 combined and now asks five times as) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 483.20 Tm (much, and the listing claims TZ zoning while the map shows R20 residential and M1 industrial [yVhfvSQwGRQ @) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 467.97 Tm (00:02:06]. LandGate adds the term trap: leases run 20 to 30 years and must allow periodic facility upgrades as) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 452.75 Tm (technology changes [Yes7DTfUfJs @ 00:01:44]. The Land Owl verdict: the listing tells you what you want to hear.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 437.52 Tm (Build-out is where the schedule breaks. IndiGrid's Sanand battery containers run about 20 feet long, 8 feet wide, 9.5) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 422.30 Tm (feet high and 43 tons each, and shock, vibration or temperature deviation can permanently damage internal cell) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 407.07 Tm (structure; the site team warns any damage can lead to an explosion, and unloading one container took more than 3) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 391.85 Tm (hours just from trailer to ground [x9hN7fa_OOI @ 00:08:07]. Laying the heavy cables needs at least 15 to 20 people,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 376.62 Tm (and any damage to a cable means repeating the job [x9hN7fa_OOI @ 00:15:28]. Then the EMS data layer slipped,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 361.40 Tm (producing tense moments on site from a manager who was under the impression the gear was fully ready, just power) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 346.17 Tm (plug and the project is complete [x9hN7fa_OOI @ 00:16:07]. Gore Street Capital lists the same bleed points in) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 330.95 Tm (sequence: regulatory risk with tariffs imposed within a short duration, construction delays that heavily impact the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 315.72 Tm (investment case, and revenue streams that evolve so you may not have the same ones by the time you're operational) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 300.50 Tm ([9jXkiEU8op0 @ 00:04:32]. The desk's counter is aligning construction programs with lawyers around likely) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 285.27 Tm (regulatory changes and building a system capable of adapting rather than one locked to day-one revenue.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 270.05 Tm (The economics check starts with fade. eFinancial Models cites battery capacity degradation of 1.5 to 3.5% per year) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 254.82 Tm (depending on source, offers fading curves that accelerate with age, and treats a refill or recycling supplier bringing) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 239.60 Tm (capacity back to 95% as a scenario only if such a supplier can be found [8xq5_kt3OY0 @ 00:15:13]. The same) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 224.37 Tm (template runs 95% battery availability, holds 20% as a never-discharged minimum load per supplier guidance, and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 209.15 Tm (warns battery lifetimes are much shorter than the solar farm, triggering replacement capex or an opex refill line) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 193.92 Tm ([8xq5_kt3OY0 @ 00:08:00]. The modeler's fix is calibration: if lifetime cycles climb too high under a two-cycle plan,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 178.70 Tm (adjust the expected lifetime until the numbers make sense. Learn Solar & BESS names staggering upfront capital, a) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 163.47 Tm (dangerous reliance on imported lithium, no standardized integration policies, and ambiguous rules on recovering costs) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 148.25 Tm (as compounding bottlenecks hitting developers all at once [i_OH8wyz41M @ 00:06:15]. On the tower side, the cost) Tj ET
